   162	    When *ps_lines* is omitted, reads real ``ps -eo pid,ppid,etime,time,args``
   163	    output. Also attempts to resolve each process's cwd so correlation can match
   164	    processes to plans even when the cmdline does not name the plan directly.
   165	    """
