    60	  `human_required`/unknown projection that disagrees with deterministic source
    61	  evidence emits drift and cannot suppress repair eligibility or escalation.
    62	
    63	## Out of scope
    64	
    65	Recovery/effect policy implementation, new product topology, production
    66	notification policy, final compatibility deletion, or operational deployment.
    67	
    68	## Locked decisions
    69	
    70	Process/tmux/heartbeat/activity is correlated evidence only. Observers never
    71	append activity or refresh liveness. Projections carry source versions,
    72	freshness, lag, and uncertainty. RunAuthorityView, CanonicalRunState, custody,
    73	status, and receipt projections are visibly non-authoritative as bearer tokens
    74	and have no route back into dispatch, repair, retry, completion, cancellation,
    75	publication, or delivery.
    76	
    77	## Implemented adjacent slice: review/rework presentation
    78	
    79	Source commit `07f428d361f63c465b0dafaca9783585efeaa4b9` implements the
    80	current artifact-backed presentation semantics across the shared status
    81	projection, cloud snapshot/formatter, resident hot context/status tree, CLI,
    82	and `/whats-cooking`. An active execute after `needs_rework` is presented as
    83	`reworking`; active review is `reviewing`; pending rework is `needs_rework`;
    84	and full task weight is labeled plan bookkeeping rather than acceptance.
    85	Approved idle-finalized and genuinely completed states retain precedence.
    86	
    87	The focused status/resident verification recorded 170 passing tests, with
    88	Python compilation and `git diff --check` also passing. This is an adjacent M9
    89	consumer-consistency slice, not M9 completion: it does not claim the later WBC,
    90	Run Authority, custody-cursor, rebuildability, or rollout evidence required by
    91	this brief.
    92	
    93	## Open questions
    94	
    95	- What freshness/lag SLO and bounded reread policy applies per dimension?
    96	- Which process-birth, environment, runner-lease, and heartbeat identities are
    97	  required to exclude unrelated, recycled, hung, or dead workers?
    98	- What degraded/unknown wording and operator affordance avoids optimistic
    99	  collapse without hiding actionable evidence gaps?
   100	- Which compatibility projections are required for historical consumers and
   101	  what are their expiry and zero-reader gates?
   102	
   103	## Constraints
   104	
   105	All consumers use M8 exact-version identities. No raw legacy artifact, receipt,
   106	projection, or process fact may be parsed for authority. Projection rebuild may
   107	not mutate underlying history/evidence. Production control behavior remains
   108	disabled during shadow comparison and fault testing.
   109	
   110	## Done criteria

